  "text": "CAR, chimeric antigen receptor; ECOG, eastern cooperative oncology group; GCS, glasgow coma scale; HSCT, hematopoietic stem-cell transplantation; IQR, interquartile range; SAPS II, simplified acute physiology score version II; SOFA, sepsis-related organ failure assessment."
}

